#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1386
msgid ""
"Which PayPal buttons (e.g. Pay Later, Venmo, SEPA, iDEAL, Mercado Pago, "
"Bancontact, etc.) will appear?"
msgstr ""
"Quels boutons PayPal (par ex. Pay Later, Venmo, SEPA, iDEAL, Mercado Pago, "
"Bancontact, etc.) apparaîtront ?"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1390
msgid ""
"The PayPal buttons are shown automatically based on several factors, "
"including:"
msgstr ""
"Les boutons PayPal sont affichés automatiquement en fonction de plusieurs "
"facteurs, notamment :"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1392
msgid "The buyer’s country"
msgstr "Le pays de l’acheteur"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1393
msgid "Their device type"
msgstr "Leur type d’appareil"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1394
msgid "The funding sources they’ve enabled"
msgstr "Les sources de financement qu’ils ont activées"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1396
msgid ""
"As a result, each buyer may see a different set of buttons. Pay Later "
"options vary by country and may display different buttons."
msgstr ""
"En conséquence, chaque acheteur peut voir un ensemble différent de boutons. "
"Les options Pay Later varient selon le pays et peuvent afficher des boutons "
"différents."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1402
msgid "How can I hide specific PayPal buttons?"
msgstr "Comment puis-je masquer des boutons PayPal spécifiques ?"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1406
msgid ""
"By default, all PayPal buttons are enabled. To hide specific buttons, use "
"the <strong>Disable Specific Payment Buttons</strong> option."
msgstr ""
"Par défaut, tous les boutons PayPal sont activés. Pour masquer des boutons "
"spécifiques, utilisez l’option <strong>Désactiver des boutons de paiement "
"spécifiques</strong>."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1407
msgid "Example: To hide the Pay Later button on the Checkout Page:"
msgstr "Exemple : Pour masquer le bouton Pay Later sur la page de paiement :"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1409
#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1426
msgid "Go to <strong>PayPal Settings</strong> > Checkout Page"
msgstr "Allez dans <strong>Paramètres PayPal</strong> > Page de paiement"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1410
msgid "Find the <strong>Disable Specific Payment Buttons</strong> setting."
msgstr ""
"Trouvez le paramètre <strong>Désactiver des boutons de paiement "
"spécifiques</strong>."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1411
msgid "Select <strong>Pay Later</strong> from the dropdown list."
msgstr "Sélectionnez <strong>Pay Later</strong> dans la liste déroulante."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1412
#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1428
#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1434
#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1451
#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1457
msgid "Click <strong>Save Changes</strong>."
msgstr "Cliquez sur <strong>Enregistrer les modifications</strong>."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1419
msgid "How can I show only the \"PayPal\" button on the Checkout page?"
msgstr "Comment afficher uniquement le bouton « PayPal » sur la page de paiement ?"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1423
msgid ""
"To display only the \"PayPal\" button on the Checkout page, follow these "
"steps:"
msgstr ""
"Pour afficher uniquement le bouton « PayPal » sur la page de paiement, "
"suivez ces étapes :"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1424
#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1447
msgid "Step 1: Update PayPal Settings"
msgstr "Étape 1 : Mettre à jour les paramètres PayPal"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1427
msgid ""
"Under <strong>Disable Specific Payment Buttons</strong>, select "
"<strong>Credit or Debit Card</strong> and any other methods you want to "
"hide."
msgstr ""
"Sous <strong>Désactiver des boutons de paiement spécifiques</strong>, "
"sélectionnez <strong>Carte de crédit ou de débit</strong> et toutes les "
"autres méthodes que vous souhaitez masquer."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1430
msgid "Step 2: Update Advanced Card Payments Settings"
msgstr "Étape 2 : Mettre à jour les paramètres des paiements par carte avancés"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1432
#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1455
msgid "Go to <strong>Advanced Card Payments</strong> settings."
msgstr "Allez dans les paramètres <strong>Paiements par carte avancés</strong>."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1433
msgid "Disable the option <strong>Enable Advanced Credit/Debit Card</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Désactivez l’option <strong>Activer la carte de crédit/débit "
"avancée</strong>."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1436
msgid ""
"Once you save the changes in both sections, only the \"PayPal\" button will "
"appear on the Checkout page."
msgstr ""
"Une fois les modifications enregistrées dans les deux sections, seul le "
"bouton « PayPal » apparaîtra sur la page de paiement."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1442
msgid ""
"How can I show only the \"Credit or Debit Card\" payment method on the "
"Checkout page?"
msgstr ""
"Comment afficher uniquement la méthode de paiement « Carte de crédit ou de "
"débit » sur la page de paiement ?"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1446
msgid ""
"To display only the \"Credit or Debit Card\" payment method on the Checkout "
"page, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"Pour afficher uniquement la méthode de paiement « Carte de crédit ou de "
"débit » sur la page de paiement, suivez ces étapes :"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1449
msgid "Go to <strong>PayPal Settings > Checkout Page</strong>."
msgstr "Allez dans <strong>Paramètres PayPal > Page de paiement</strong>."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1450
msgid "Disable the <strong>Enable PayPal</strong> option."
msgstr "Désactivez l’option <strong>Activer PayPal</strong>."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1453
msgid "Step 2: Enable Advanced Credit/Debit Card Payments"
msgstr "Étape 2 : Activer les paiements par carte de crédit/débit avancés"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1456
msgid "Enable the option <strong>Enable Advanced Credit/Debit Card</strong>."
msgstr "Activez l’option <strong>Activer la carte de crédit/débit avancée</strong>."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1459
msgid ""
"Once you save the changes in both sections, only the \"Credit or Debit "
"Card\" payment method will appear on the Checkout page."
msgstr ""
"Une fois les modifications enregistrées dans les deux sections, seule la "
"méthode de paiement « Carte de crédit ou de débit » apparaîtra sur la page "
"de paiement."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1465
msgid "What is PayPal Pay Later?"
msgstr "Qu’est-ce que PayPal Pay Later ?"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1469
msgid ""
"PayPal Pay Later lets your customers split their purchases into "
"interest-free payments over time, such as \"Pay in 4\" or monthly "
"installments. You get paid in full upfront, while customers enjoy flexible "
"payment options."
msgstr ""
"PayPal Pay Later permet à vos clients de diviser leurs achats en paiements "
"sans intérêt sur la durée, comme « Payer en 4 fois » ou des versements "
"mensuels. Vous êtes payé intégralement d’avance, tandis que les clients "
"profitent d’options de paiement flexibles."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1470
msgid ""
"This can help increase your sales, with many merchants seeing higher "
"conversion rates and larger order sizes."
msgstr ""
