#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:747
#. translators: Admin notice explaining how to enable PayPal Advanced Card Payments. HTML <br> tags are intentional for formatting.
msgid ""
"To use Advanced Card Payments, ensure your PayPal account is eligible and "
"enabled:<br><br>\n"
"                <strong>Steps:</strong><br>\n"
"                1. Visit developer.paypal.com → Apps & Credentials → API "
"Credentials.<br>\n"
"                2. Click your App Name.<br>\n"
"                3. Under \"Features\" → Accept Payments, check if "
"\"Advanced Credit and Debit Card Payments\" is enabled.<br>\n"
"                4. If missing, your account or region may not support it."
msgstr ""
"Pour utiliser les paiements par carte avancés, assurez-vous que votre "
"compte PayPal est éligible et activé : <br><br>\n"
"                <strong>Étapes : </strong><br>\n"
"                1. Visitez Developer.paypal.com → Applications et "
"informations d'identification → API Credentials.<br>\n"
"                2. Cliquez sur le nom de votre application.<br>\n"
"                3. Sous « Fonctionnalités » → Accepter les paiements, "
"vérifiez si « Paiements avancés par carte de crédit et de débit » est "
"activé.<br>\n"
"                4. S'il est manquant, votre compte ou votre région peut ne "
"pas le prendre en charge."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:824
msgid "Fastlane by PayPal"
msgstr "Voie rapide par PayPal"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:826
msgid ""
"Fastlane offers an accelerated guest checkout: returning Fastlane members "
"are recognized by their email address, verify with a one-time code and pay "
"with their saved card — no typing, no account needed on your store. New "
"customers can enroll during checkout. Fastlane requires Advanced Card "
"Processing and is currently available to US merchants transacting in USD."
msgstr ""
"Fastlane propose un paiement accéléré pour les invités : les membres "
"Fastlane qui reviennent sont reconnus par leur adresse e-mail, vérifient "
"avec un code à usage unique et paient avec leur carte enregistrée - aucune "
"saisie, aucun compte requis sur votre boutique. Les nouveaux clients "
"peuvent s'inscrire lors du paiement. Fastlane nécessite un traitement "
"avancé des cartes et est actuellement disponible pour les commerçants "
"américains effectuant des transactions en USD."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:830
msgid "Enable Fastlane by PayPal"
msgstr "Activer Fastlane par PayPal"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:833
msgid ""
"Adds Fastlane accelerated checkout to the Advanced Credit/Debit Card "
"gateway. Shoppers who enter a Fastlane member email address are offered a "
"one-time-code login and can pay with their saved card in a couple of clicks."
msgstr ""
"Ajoute le paiement accéléré Fastlane à la passerelle avancée de carte de "
"crédit/débit. Les acheteurs qui saisissent une adresse e-mail de membre "
"Fastlane se voient proposer une connexion à code unique et peuvent payer "
"avec leur carte enregistrée en quelques clics."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:837
msgid "Fastlane Flow"
msgstr "Flux de voie rapide"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:842
msgid "Email Detection"
msgstr "Détection des e-mails"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:843
msgid "Express Button"
msgstr "Bouton Express"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:845
msgid ""
"Email Detection (recommended by PayPal): Fastlane engages automatically "
"when the customer enters a member email address. Express Button: a Fastlane "
"button is shown in the express checkout section at the top of the checkout "
"page and the customer starts Fastlane by clicking it."
msgstr ""
"Détection d'e-mail (recommandé par PayPal) : Fastlane s'engage "
"automatiquement lorsque le client saisit une adresse e-mail de membre. "
"Bouton Express : un bouton Fastlane est affiché dans la section de paiement "
"express en haut de la page de paiement et le client démarre Fastlane en "
"cliquant dessus."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:849
msgid "Authenticate On Page Load"
msgstr "Authentifier lors du chargement de la page"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:850
msgid "Start Fastlane authentication when the checkout page loads"
msgstr "Démarrez l'authentification Fastlane lorsque la page de paiement se charge"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:853
msgid ""
"If the billing email address is already populated when the checkout page "
"loads (for example a logged-in returning customer), start the Fastlane "
"member lookup and one-time-code verification right away instead of waiting "
"for the customer to edit the email field."
msgstr ""
"Si l'adresse e-mail de facturation est déjà renseignée lors du chargement "
"de la page de paiement (par exemple, un client récurrent connecté), "
"démarrez immédiatement la recherche de membre Fastlane et la vérification "
"du code à usage unique au lieu d'attendre que le client modifie le champ "
"e-mail."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:857
msgid "Fastlane Watermark"
msgstr "Filigrane Fastlane"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:858
msgid "Show the \"Fastlane by PayPal\" watermark under the email field"
msgstr "Afficher le filigrane \"Fastlane by PayPal\" sous le champ e-mail"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:861
msgid ""
"Displays the Fastlane watermark below the billing email field so customers "
"know their email address is checked against Fastlane. Recommended by PayPal."
msgstr ""
"Affiche le filigrane Fastlane sous le champ de l'e-mail de facturation afin "
"que les clients sachent que leur adresse e-mail est vérifiée par rapport à "
"Fastlane. Recommandé par PayPal."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:865
msgid "Email Field At Top"
msgstr "Champ de courrier électronique en haut"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:866
msgid "Move the email address field to the top of the billing form"
msgstr "Déplacez le champ de l'adresse e-mail en haut du formulaire de facturation"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:869
msgid ""
"Fastlane recognizes customers by their email address, so asking for it "
"first gives returning members the fastest possible checkout. Applies to the "
"classic checkout form; the block checkout already asks for the email "
"address first."
msgstr ""
"Fastlane reconnaît les clients grâce à leur adresse e-mail, donc la "
"demander d'abord permet aux membres fidèles de bénéficier du paiement le "
"plus rapide possible. S'applique au formulaire de paiement classique ; le "
"paiement en bloc demande déjà d'abord l'adresse e-mail."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:873
msgid "Fastlane Signup Link"
msgstr "Lien d'inscription Fastlane"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:874
msgid "Show a \"Pay faster with Fastlane\" link to non-members"
msgstr "Afficher un lien « Payez plus rapidement avec Fastlane » aux non-membres"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:877
msgid ""
"When the entered email address is not a Fastlane member, show a link above "
"the card fields that lets the customer enter their card through Fastlane "
"and join for faster future checkouts."
msgstr ""
"Lorsque l'adresse e-mail saisie n'est pas membre de Fastlane, affichez un "
"lien au-dessus des champs de la carte qui permet au client de saisir sa "
"carte via Fastlane et de s'inscrire pour des paiements futurs plus rapides."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:1950
msgid "Authorized Order Status"
msgstr "Statut de la commande autorisée"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:1953
msgid "If the transaction is authorized, this status will be applied to the order."
msgstr "Si la transaction est autorisée, ce statut sera appliqué à la commande."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:1959
msgid "Capture Order Statuses"
msgstr "Capturer les statuts des commandes"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:1962
msgid ""
"Authorized payments will be captured when the order moves to one of these "
